<p>Using the <strong class="selflink">ToDoListItem</strong> template on a page adds to a dynamic "To do list for &lt;user&gt;" category. A user's "ToDoList" can be rendered using the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Template%20-%20ToDoList" title="Template:ToDoList">ToDoList</a> template.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h2>
<pre>
{{ToDoListItem|Sunjammer}}
</pre>
